_tools/
*.py
__pycache__/
# Per-manual CLAUDE.md files stay local, like every other manual's (none are tracked).
CLAUDE.md
web/CLAUDE.md
# Two parents, one folder per manual, each named after its ledger base name
# (File_name_manager/管理台帳.xlsx — CLAUDE.md "Naming"):
#   software/<ID>/   14 paged manuals, <ID> = <Software>_<Major>_<Type>_v<N>  (sheet 1)
#   web/<ID>/        18 no-PDF support pages, <ID> = the page slug            (sheet 2)
# Sources + deliverables stay local; the <ID>_Image/ dirs are deliberately NOT ignored,
# they are the jsDelivr payload this repo exists to serve, and their repo path MUST
# equal the CDN url segment (pitfall 17).
software/*/*.docx
software/*/*.doc
software/*/*.pdf
software/*/*.md
software/*/*.json
web/*/*.docx
web/*/*.doc
web/*/*.pdf
web/*/*.md
web/*/*.json

# Map deliverables rewritten for the Cloudflare Pages CDN. Never committed HERE:
# this repo is the image host, where a directory path IS the published url, so a
# committed Cloudflare/ would publish the maps at gd-img-cdn.pages.dev/Cloudflare/.
# They belong in Dify_file_manager instead.
Cloudflare/

# Obsolete: staging tree for the old direct-upload flow, kept ignored so a stale
# local copy can never be committed. Pages now builds from GitHub (see wrangler.jsonc).
_cdn_payload/
